Short verdict: You'll like this score a lot if you're a fan of *Ghosts I-IV*, Nine Inch Nails's calming/haunting instrumental album from 2008. The soundtrack album releases on Sept. 28, but you can get a free 5-track sampler starting today, or pre-order the score on CD, vinyl or audio Blu-ray.
